# Key Insights

### Insight 1

Customers without contract renewals are significantly more likely to leave.

### Insight 2

High customer service call frequency is strongly associated with churn.

### Insight 3

Higher monthly charges and overage fees increase customer attrition.

### Insight 4

Long-tenure customers demonstrate stronger loyalty.

### Insight 5

Data plan subscribers show higher retention rates.

### Insight 6

Customer service quality appears to be a major determinant of customer satisfaction.

